<title>USA: New York certificated cotton stocks rise to 93,383.</title>
<headline>New York certificated cotton stocks rise to 93,383.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-01-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Certificated cotton stocks deliverable against New York Cotton Exchange's No. 2 cotton futures contract as of Jan 15 totaled 93,383 bales, up from 92,613 bales the previous session.</p>
<p>There were 770 bales issued, no decertification orders, no cancellations, and 3,157 bales awaiting review.</p>
<p>-- New York Commodities Desk 212-859-1640</p>
</text>
